# AVD Architecture and Operations

## 1. Purpose and scope

This document describes the expected architecture and operational boundaries of the fictional Contoso AVD POC. The agent must compare these expectations with current Azure configuration and telemetry, report discrepancies, and never treat this file alone as proof of live health.

- FSLogix design and troubleshooting: `AVD-FSLogix.md`
- Severity, ownership and escalation: `AVD-Escalation.md`
- Time zone for operational schedules: `$Location`; use UTC timestamps for incident timelines.

