- Operating system: Windows 11 Enterprise multi-session.
- Join type: Hybrid Microsoft Entra joined; AD DS domain `$ADDSDomainName`.
- Image source: Azure Compute Gallery; record the actual gallery, definition and version before production use.
- Image update approach: Replace session hosts with hosts based on an approved new image version; drain and validate capacity first.
